Note on bundled artifacts
-------------------------

The implementation under src/, scripts/, and tests/ is covered by the MIT
license above.

The WANDS dataset (Wayfair ANnotation Dataset) is NOT redistributed in this
repository. It is fetched from the official source (https://github.com/wayfair/WANDS,
MIT license) and verified against the frozen manifest in data_manifests/wands.json.

The frozen semantic-label tape (cache/labels_wands.sqlite) contains derived
semantic labels computed over a WANDS subset with a local open-weight model, and
is released under the same MIT terms as the underlying data.
